## Model card

- **Name:** Inkling Small
- **Short description:** Thinking Machines’ Inkling Small is described in local metadata as an open-weight hybrid-reasoning model with multimodal inputs (text/image/audio) for coding and agent workloads.
- **Provider / access:** Open-weights model (Hugging Face referenced in local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/inkling-small`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
