- **Modalities:** Text in/out; image and audio input (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Open weights (free self-host) per local metadata.
- **Architecture:** 276B/12B hybrid-reasoning model per local metadata; not independently verified in this pass.

